@startuml 06-tool-approval-sequence
!include theme.puml
title Tool Runtime：扩展、技术审批与业务 ApprovalCase 的职责边界

autonumber
box "Agent Kernel" LC_KERNEL
participant "Agent Loop Engine" as LOOP
participant "Tool Registry" as REGISTRY
participant "Tool Policy Engine" as POLICY
participant "Tool Execution Guard" as GUARD
participant "技术审批协调器" as TECH_APPROVAL
participant "AgentGateway / Event Journal" as GW
end box

participant "业务编排\nApprovalCase" as BUSINESS LC_ORCHESTRATION
participant "ToolProviderPort" as TOOL_PORT LC_KERNEL
participant "只读 Tool Provider" as TOOL_PROVIDER LC_ADAPTER

LOOP -> REGISTRY : resolve(tool_name, version)
REGISTRY --> LOOP : ToolDescriptor + JSON Schema + 风险元数据
LOOP -> POLICY : evaluate(RequestContext, descriptor, args_ref, policy_ref)
POLICY -> GUARD : 路径 / 租户 / 出口 / 大小 / deadline 校验

alt 静态策略允许
  GUARD --> LOOP : ALLOW
else 需要外部技术决定
  GUARD -> TECH_APPROVAL : 创建 TechnicalApprovalRequest
  TECH_APPROVAL -> GW : 追加 ApprovalRequired 后发布
  GW -->> BUSINESS : AgentEvent 技术审批信号
  BUSINESS -> BUSINESS : 创建并裁决业务 ApprovalCase
  BUSINESS -> GW : decision.submit(technical_request_id, decision)
  GW -> TECH_APPROVAL : 校验 tenant / run / 状态 / decision_id
  TECH_APPROVAL --> LOOP : ALLOW / DENY
end

alt ALLOW
  LOOP -> TOOL_PORT : execute(RequestContext, bounded request)
  TOOL_PORT -> TOOL_PROVIDER : Provider 私有调用
  TOOL_PROVIDER --> TOOL_PORT : ToolResult / 稳定技术错误
  TOOL_PORT --> LOOP : 规范化 ToolResult
else DENY
  LOOP --> LOOP : ToolDenied 进入下一轮上下文
end

note right of BUSINESS
  ApprovalCase 的审批人、策略和业务结果
  全部属于业务编排，不属于 Kernel。
end note
note over LOOP,TOOL_PORT
  Tool Runtime 拥有技术扩展协议与执行安全，Provider 只提供机制。
  首版仅注册 list_files / read_text / search_text。
  约束：UP-AGT-002、UP-AGT-006、UP-AGT-009、UP-SEC-001
end note
@enduml
